```

#### `test_jump_mario`
**Key Functionality:** Test that Mario jumps upward when the jump method is called.

```pseudocode
CLASS Mario
    FUNCTION __init__(x, y)
        SET self.y = y
        SET self.is_jumping = False
        
    FUNCTION jump()
        IF NOT self.is_jumping
            SET self.is_jumping = True  // Set jumping state
        
    FUNCTION update()
        IF self.is_jumping
            IF jump_count >= 0
                CALCULATE vertical movement based on jump dynamics
                DECREMENT self.jump_count
            ELSE
                SET self.is_jumping = False
```

