S Block\n    FUNCTION release_mushroom()\n        RETURN new Mushroom at (self.x, self.y - 20)  // Mushroom above the block\n    END FUNCTION\nEND CLASS\n    \nCLASS Game\n    FUNCTION handle_collisions()\n        FOR EACH block IN blocks\n            IF Mario's x is in range of block.x AND Mario's y is at the level of block.y\n                Mario.hit_block()\n                new_mushroom = block.release_mushroom()\n                Add new_mushroom to mushrooms  // Add released mushroom\n            END IF\n        END FOR\n    END FUNCTION\nEND CLASS\n```\n", "|Case|:**jump_mario**\n```pseudocode\nCLASS Mario\n    FUNCTION jump()\n        Decrease Mario's y by 10  // Simplified jump logic\n    END FUNCTION\nEND CLASS\n    \nCLASS Game\n    FUNCTION handle_events()\n        IF SPACE key is pressed THEN\n            Mario.jump()  # Handle jumping\n        END IF\n    END FUNCTION\nEND CLASS\n```\n|Case|:**move_mario**\n```pseudocode\nCLASS Mario\n    FUNCTION move_left()\n        Decrease Mario's x by 5  // Move Mario left\n\n    FUNCTION move_right()\n        Increase Mario's x by 5  // Move Mario right\n    END FUNCTION\nEND CLASS\n    \nCLASS Game\n    FUNCTION handle_events()\n        IF LEFT key is pressed THEN\n            Mario.move_left()  # Handle moving left\n        IF RIGHT key is pressed THEN\n            Mario.move_right()  # Handle moving right\n        END IF\n    END FUNCTION\nEND CLASS\n```"]
